{"ok": true, "summary": "Built a 312 × 217 mm, R8 display A-cover with a 0.8 mm magnesium wall, 6.5 mm flange, 45 mm rib grid, six hinge bosses, and a 10 mm PC+GF antenna insert. The concept includes a display-side adhesive track, two mold halves, four ejectors, a fan gate, and four vented overflows. Opening lifts the fixed half 120 mm and ejects the casting 15 mm. All features follow the ejection direction, so slides are not required. The 1° draft is a tooling requirement; detailed drafted cavity surfaces are not resolved. Mass uses additive feature volumes without intersection deductions; the adhesive track is represented without an assumed groove depth. This is a conceptual structure and tooling layout, without mold-flow or solidification analysis.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>A-cover and casting tool concept</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#263244}\n#panel h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px}\n.row{margin:5px 0} .legend{font-size:11px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:11px}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n.buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:20%;right:20%;color:#b91c1c;background:white;padding:15px;text-align:center}\n#status{font-size:11px;color:#687386}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Display A-cover · die-casting concept</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">312 × 217 mm · R8 · wall 0.8 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Flange 6.5 × 1 · ribs 0.8 × 2 / pitch 45 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">6 × Ø4.5 × 3.5 bosses · M2 pilot holes pending</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Draft 1° · Slides: No; all features eject along +Y</div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"mass\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"production\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\">● Gray: AZ91D · Black: PC+GF · Gold: feed / overflow</div>\n<div class=\"legend\">● Slate: conceptual dies · Blue: adhesive track / cavity</div>\n<div id=\"status\">Loading opaque assembly reference…</div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate</button><button id=\"mold\">Mold view</button><button id=\"open\">Open mold</button><button id=\"ref\">Hide reference</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nimport { GLTFLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js';\nconst P = {\n // Dimensions in mm; densities in g/cm³.\n width:312,depth:217,radius:8,wall:0.8,flangeHeight:6.5,flangeThickness:1,\n ribWidth:0.8,ribHeight:2,ribPitch:45,antenna:10,adhesiveWidth:3,\n bossDiameter:4.5,bossHeight:3.5,bossCount:6,bossX:[-120,-108,-96,96,108,120],bossZ:98,\n mgDensity:1.81,plasticDensity:1.40,draft:1,\n frameMargin:150,halfHeight:250,openTravel:120,ejectTravel:15,animationSeconds:0.8,\n pressure:60,safety:1.2,gravity:9.81,cycle:45,shiftHours:8,oee:0.85,\n priceKg:28,runnerRatio:0.35,recovery:0.40,referenceX:420,\n gateNeck:12,gateSpread:65,gateLength:45,gateThickness:2,biscuitRadius:22,biscuitHeight:12,\n overflowWidth:22,overflowLength:16,overflowThickness:2,ventWidth:3,ventLength:22,ventThickness:0.3,\n ejectorRadius:3,ejectorLength:55,adhesiveInset:5,explodeSpacing:22\n};\nfunction showError(message){const el=document.getElementById('error');el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Viewer error: '+message;}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\nconst renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\nrenderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\nrenderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\nrenderer.toneMapping=THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\ndocument.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\nconst scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\nscene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\nscene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\nconst light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);light.position.set(300,800,400);scene.add(light);\nconst camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\nconst controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\ncontrols.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1;\ncontrols.addEventListener('start',()=>controls.autoRotate=false);\nconst modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\nconst groups={};\nfor(const name of ['cover','ribs','bosses','insert','die_fixed','die_moving','gate','overflows','reference']){\n const group=new THREE.Group();group.name=name;groups[name]=group;\n (name==='reference'?scene:modelGroup).add(group);\n}\nconst mat=(color,metalness=0.85,extra={})=>new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,metalness,roughness:0.35,...extra});\nconst mg=mat('#b8bec7',0.6),plastic=mat('#2b2b2b',0,{roughness:0.6});\nconst gold=mat('#c9a227'),steel=mat('#9aa3ab');\nconst fixedMat=mat('#64748b',0.2,{transparent:true,opacity:0.25,depthWrite:false});\nconst movingMat=mat('#475569',0.2,{transparent:true,opacity:0.25,depthWrite:false});\nconst blue=mat('#3b82f6',0,{transparent:true,opacity:0.55,depthWrite:false});\nfunction rounded(w,d,r){\n const s=new THREE.Shape(),x=-w/2,z=-d/2;\n s.moveTo(x+r,z);s.lineTo(x+w-r,z);s.quadraticCurveTo(x+w,z,x+w,z+r);\n s.lineTo(x+w,z+d-r);s.quadraticCurveTo(x+w,z+d,x+w-r,z+d);\n s.lineTo(x+r,z+d);s.quadraticCurveTo(x,z+d,x,z+d-r);\n s.lineTo(x,z+r);s.quadraticCurveTo(x,z,x+r,z);return s;\n}\nfunction extrude(shape,height,material,parent,y=0){\n const geo=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:height,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:16});\n geo.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(geo,material);mesh.position.y=y;parent.add(mesh);return mesh;\n}\nfunction box(w,h,d,material,parent,x=0,y=0,z=0){\n const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),material);mesh.position.set(x,y,z);parent.add(mesh);return mesh;\n}\nconst full=rounded(P.width,P.depth,P.radius),halfD=P.depth/2;\nconst wallMat=mg.clone(),insertMat=plastic.clone();\nwallMat.clippingPlanes=[new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,1),halfD-P.antenna)];\ninsertMat.clippingPlanes=[new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,-1),-halfD+P.antenna)];\nextrude(full,P.wall,wallMat,groups.cover);\nextrude(full,P.wall,insertMat,groups.insert);\nconst ring=rounded(P.width,P.depth,P.radius);\nring.holes.push(new THREE.Path(rounded(P.width-2*P.flangeThickness,P.depth-2*P.flangeThickness,P.radius-P.flangeThickness).getPoints(64)));\nextrude(ring,P.flangeHeight,mg,groups.cover,P.wall);\nconst nx=Math.floor((P.width-2*P.flangeThickness)/P.ribPitch);\nconst nz=Math.floor((P.depth-P.antenna-2*P.flangeThickness)/P.ribPitch);\nconst lx=P.width-2*P.flangeThickness,lz=P.depth-P.antenna-2*P.flangeThickness;\nconst ribMesh=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(1,1,1),mg,nx+nz);\nconst temp=new THREE.Object3D();\nfor(let i=0;i<nx+nz;i++){\n const vertical=i<nx,k=vertical?i:i-nx;\n temp.position.set(vertical?(k-(nx-1)/2)*P.ribPitch:0,P.wall+P.ribHeight/2,vertical?P.antenna/2:(k-(nz-1)/2)*P.ribPitch+P.antenna/2);\n temp.scale.set(vertical?P.ribWidth:lx,P.ribHeight,vertical?lz:P.ribWidth);\n temp.updateMatrix();ribMesh.setMatrixAt(i,temp.matrix);\n}\nribMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;ribMesh.computeBoundingSphere();groups.ribs.add(ribMesh);\nfor(const x of P.bossX){\n const boss=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.bossDiameter/2,P.bossDiameter/2,P.bossHeight,32),mg);\n boss.position.set(x,P.wall+P.bossHeight/2,P.bossZ);groups.bosses.add(boss);\n}\nconst track=rounded(P.width-2*P.adhesiveInset,P.depth-2*(P.antenna+P.adhesiveInset),P.radius);\ntrack.holes.push(new THREE.Path(rounded(P.width-2*(P.adhesiveInset+P.adhesiveWidth),P.depth-2*(P.antenna+P.adhesiveInset+P.adhesiveWidth),P.radius-P.adhesiveWidth).getPoints(64)));\nconst trackMesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.ShapeGeometry(track,32),blue);\ntrackMesh.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;trackMesh.position.y=P.wall+0.02;groups.cover.add(trackMesh);\nconst partY=P.wall+P.flangeHeight,mw=P.width+2*P.frameMargin,md=P.depth+2*P.frameMargin;\nbox(mw,P.halfHeight,md,fixedMat,groups.die_fixed,0,partY+P.halfHeight/2);\nbox(mw,P.halfHeight,md,movingMat,groups.die_moving,0,partY-P.halfHeight/2);\nconst ejectors=[];\nfor(const x of [-P.width/3,P.width/3])for(const z of [-P.depth/4,P.depth/4]){\n const pin=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.ejectorRadius,P.ejectorRadius,P.ejectorLength,20),steel);\n pin.position.set(x,-P.ejectorLength/2,z);groups.die_moving.add(pin);ejectors.push(pin);\n}\nconst fan=new THREE.Shape();fan.moveTo(-P.gateSpread/2,0);fan.lineTo(P.gateSpread/2,0);\nfan.lineTo(P.gateNeck/2,-P.gateLength);fan.lineTo(-P.gateNeck/2,-P.gateLength);fan.closePath();\nconst gateMesh=extrude(fan,P.gateThickness,gold,groups.gate);gateMesh.position.z=halfD;\nconst biscuit=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.biscuitRadius,P.biscuitRadius,P.biscuitHeight,32),gold);\nbiscuit.position.set(0,0,halfD+P.gateLength+P.biscuitRadius/2);groups.gate.add(biscuit);\nfor(let i=0;i<4;i++){\n const x=(i-1.5)*P.width/5;\n box(P.overflowWidth,P.overflowThickness,P.overflowLength,gold,groups.overflows,x,P.wall,-halfD-P.overflowLength/2);\n box(P.ventWidth,P.ventThickness,P.ventLength,gold,groups.overflows,x,P.wall,-halfD-P.overflowLength-P.ventLength/2);\n}\nconst toolingGuide=new THREE.Group();modelGroup.add(toolingGuide);\nconst planeGeo=new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints([[-mw/2,partY,-md/2],[mw/2,partY,-md/2],[mw/2,partY,md/2],[-mw/2,partY,md/2],[-mw/2,partY,-md/2]].map(v=>new THREE.Vector3(...v)));\ntoolingGuide.add(new THREE.Line(planeGeo,new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:'#b11f4b'})));\ntoolingGuide.add(new THREE.ArrowHelper(new THREE.Vector3(0,1,0),new THREE.Vector3(-P.width/2-30,partY,0),85,0xb11f4b,15,7));\nfunction compute(){\n const area=P.width*P.depth-(4-Math.PI)*P.radius**2;\n const antennaArea=P.width*P.antenna-(2-Math.PI/2)*P.radius**2;\n const perimeter=2*(P.width+P.depth-4*P.radius)+2*Math.PI*P.radius;\n const volume=(area-antennaArea)*P.wall+perimeter*P.flangeHeight*P.flangeThickness+(nx*lz+nz*lx)*P.ribWidth*P.ribHeight+P.bossCount*Math.PI*(P.bossDiameter/2)**2*P.bossHeight;\n const mass=volume/1000*P.mgDensity,projected=area*1.25;\n return [\n {label:'Net mass (g)',value:mass.toFixed(2),unit:'g',note:'AZ91D only; additive feature volumes'},\n {label:'Projected area (cm²)',value:(projected/100).toFixed(2),unit:'cm²',note:'Rounded outline × 1.25 feed allowance'},\n {label:'Clamping-force estimate (t)',value:(P.pressure*projected*P.safety/P.gravity/1000).toFixed(1),unit:'t',note:'60 MPa; safety 1.2; divide N by 9810'},\n {label:'Mold outline estimate (mm)',value:`${mw} × ${md} × ${2*P.halfHeight}`,unit:'mm',note:'150 mm per side; two 250 mm halves'},\n {label:'Single-shift output (pcs / 8 h)',value:Math.floor(P.shiftHours*3600/P.cycle*P.oee).toFixed(0),unit:'pcs / 8 h',note:'45 s cycle; 8 h shift; OEE 85%'},\n {label:'Material cost (CNY / pc)',value:(mass/1000*P.priceKg*(1+(1-P.recovery)*P.runnerRatio)).toFixed(2),unit:'CNY / pc',note:'28 CNY/kg; 35% feed; 40% recovered'}\n ];\n}\nconst metrics=compute();window.__metrics=metrics;\ndocument.getElementById('mass').textContent=`AZ91D ${metrics[0].value} g · clamp ${metrics[2].value} t`;\ndocument.getElementById('production').textContent=`45 s cycle · ${metrics[4].value} pcs/shift · ${metrics[5].value} CNY/pc`;\nconst bounds=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true),center=bounds.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=bounds.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\nfunction frame(){const angle=Math.min(camera.fov*Math.PI/360,Math.atan(Math.tan(camera.fov*Math.PI/360)*camera.aspect));camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(size.length()/2/Math.sin(angle)/.7));controls.target.copy(center);}\nframe();\nlet mold=false,opened=false,exploded=false,section=false,travel=0,startTravel=0,targetTravel=0,startTime=0;\nfunction updateMode(){for(const name of ['die_fixed','die_moving','gate','overflows'])groups[name].visible=mold;toolingGuide.visible=mold;document.getElementById('mold').textContent=mold?'Part view':'Mold view';}\nupdateMode();\ndocument.getElementById('mold').onclick=()=>{mold=!mold;updateMode();};\ndocument.getElementById('open').onclick=()=>{mold=true;updateMode();opened=!opened;startTravel=travel;targetTravel=opened?1:0;startTime=performance.now();document.getElementById('open').textContent=opened?'Close mold':'Open mold';};\ndocument.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{exploded=!exploded;document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'Assembled view':'Exploded view';};\ndocument.getElementById('rotate').onclick=()=>controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;\ndocument.getElementById('ref').onclick=()=>{groups.reference.visible=!groups.reference.visible;document.getElementById('ref').textContent=groups.reference.visible?'Hide reference':'Show reference';};\nconst cut=new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(-1,0,0),0);\nconst cutMaterials=[mg,wallMat,insertMat,fixedMat,movingMat,steel,gold,blue];\nconst initialPlanes=cutMaterials.map(m=>m.clippingPlanes?m.clippingPlanes.slice():[]);\ndocument.getElementById('section').onclick=()=>{section=!section;cutMaterials.forEach((m,i)=>{m.clippingPlanes=section?[...initialPlanes[i],cut]:initialPlanes[i];m.needsUpdate=true;});document.getElementById('section').textContent=section?'Full view':'Section view';};\nObject.assign(window,{__scene:scene,__camera:camera,__renderer:renderer,__controls:controls,__model:modelGroup});\nfunction planarUV(geo){\n geo.computeBoundingBox();const b=geo.boundingBox,s=b.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n const axes=['x','y','z'].sort((a,c)=>s[c]-s[a]),pos=geo.attributes.position,uv=new Float32Array(pos.count*2),v=new THREE.Vector3();\n for(let i=0;i<pos.count;i++){v.fromBufferAttribute(pos,i);uv[i*2]=(v[axes[0]]-b.min[axes[0]])/(s[axes[0]]||1);uv[i*2+1]=(v[axes[1]]-b.min[axes[1]])/(s[axes[1]]||1);}\n geo.setAttribute('uv',new THREE.BufferAttribute(uv,2));\n}\nconst canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=768;canvas.height=512;\nconst ctx=canvas.getContext('2d'),gradient=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,768,512);\ngradient.addColorStop(0,'#0b1a3a');gradient.addColorStop(1,'#1e3a8a');ctx.fillStyle=gradient;ctx.fillRect(0,0,768,512);\nfor(const [x,y,r,color] of [[230,180,300,'rgba(56,189,248,.75)'],[580,250,270,'rgba(232,121,249,.55)'],[400,490,240,'rgba(250,204,21,.35)']]){\n const g=ctx.createRadialGradient(x,y,0,x,y,r);g.addColorStop(0,color);g.addColorStop(1,'transparent');ctx.fillStyle=g;ctx.fillRect(0,0,768,512);\n}\nconst texture=new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);texture.colorSpace=THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\nconst referenceMaterials={body:mat('#cfd0cc',.85,{roughness:.32}),keys:mat('#2a2b2e',.1,{roughness:.55}),pad:mat('#dcdcd8',.3,{roughness:.25}),dark:mat('#1c1c1e',0,{roughness:.6}),screen:mat('#ffffff',0,{map:texture,emissiveMap:texture,emissive:'#ffffff',emissiveIntensity:.6,roughness:.2})};\ngroups.reference.position.x=P.referenceX;\nnew GLTFLoader().load('/static/assets/notebook/laptop14_open.glb',gltf=>{\n try{gltf.scene.traverse(obj=>{if(!obj.isMesh)return;let node=obj,name=obj.name.toLowerCase();while(node.parent&&!/^(base|lid|keys|touchpad|screen|hinge_|feet)/.test(name)){node=node.parent;name=node.name.toLowerCase();}obj.material=name.startsWith('screen')?referenceMaterials.screen:name.startsWith('keys')?referenceMaterials.keys:name.startsWith('touchpad')?referenceMaterials.pad:/^(hinge_|feet)/.test(name)?referenceMaterials.dark:referenceMaterials.body;if(name.startsWith('screen'))planarUV(obj.geometry);});groups.reference.add(gltf.scene);document.getElementById('status').textContent='Right: assembly reference; A-cover is screen rear. Track depth and M2 pilots unresolved.';}catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n},undefined,()=>{box(P.width,14.5,P.depth,mat('#cfd0cc',.85,{transparent:true,opacity:.35}),groups.reference);document.getElementById('status').textContent='Reference unavailable: placeholder shown. Blue track has no assigned depth.';});\nwindow.addEventListener('resize',()=>{camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);});\nfunction animate(now){\n requestAnimationFrame(animate);const t=Math.min(1,(now-startTime)/(P.animationSeconds*1000));travel=THREE.MathUtils.lerp(startTravel,targetTravel,t*t*(3-2*t));\n groups.die_fixed.position.y=travel*P.openTravel;\n for(const name of ['cover','ribs','bosses','insert','gate','overflows'])groups[name].position.y=travel*P.ejectTravel;\n if(exploded){groups.ribs.position.y+=P.explodeSpacing;groups.bosses.position.y+=2*P.explodeSpacing;groups.insert.position.y+=3*P.explodeSpacing;}\n for(const pin of ejectors)pin.position.y=-P.ejectorLength/2+travel*P.ejectTravel;\n controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);\n}\nrequestAnimationFrame(animate);\n}catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Net mass (g)", "value": "109.59", "unit": "g", "note": "AZ91D only; additive feature volumes"}, {"label": "Projected area (cm²)", "value": "845.61", "unit": "cm²", "note": "Rounded outline × 1.25 feed allowance"}, {"label": "Clamping-force estimate (t)", "value": "620.6", "unit": "t", "note": "60 MPa; safety 1.2; divide N by 9810"}, {"label": "Mold outline estimate (mm)", "value": "612 × 517 × 500", "unit": "mm", "note": "150 mm per side; two 250 mm halves"}, {"label": "Single-shift output (pcs / 8 h)", "value": "544", "unit": "pcs / 8 h", "note": "45 s cycle; 8 h shift; OEE 85%"}, {"label": "Material cost (CNY / pc)", "value": "3.71", "unit": "CNY / pc", "note": "28 CNY/kg; 35% feed; 40% recovered"}], "suggestions": ["Add resolved 1° draft, M2 pilot holes, and a dimensioned adhesive groove.", "Compare 0.8 mm and 1.0 mm walls for mass, cost, and casting risk.", "Develop cavity inserts, cooling circuits, and an ejector layout for tooling review."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nBuilt a 312 × 217 mm, R8 display A-cover with a 0.8 mm magnesium wall, 6.5 mm flange, 45 mm rib grid, six hinge bosses, and a 10 mm PC+GF antenna insert. The concept includes a display-side adhesive track, two mold halves, four ejectors, a fan gate, and four vented overflows. Opening lifts the fixed half 120 mm and ejects the casting 15 mm. All features follow the ejection direction, so slides are not required. The 1° draft is a tooling requirement; detailed drafted cavity surfaces are not resolved. Mass uses additive feature volumes without intersection deductions; the adhesive track is represented without an assumed groove depth. This is a conceptual structure and tooling layout, without mold-flow or solidification analysis.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>A-cover and casting tool concept</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#263244}\n#panel h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px}\n.row{margin:5px 0} .legend{font-size:11px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:11px}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n.buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:20%;right:20%;color:#b91c1c;background:white;padding:15px;text-align:center}\n#status{font-size:11px;color:#687386}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Display A-cover · die-casting concept</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">312 × 217 mm · R8 · wall 0.8 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Flange 6.5 × 1 · ribs 0.8 × 2 / pitch 45 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">6 × Ø4.5 × 3.5 bosses · M2 pilot holes pending</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Draft 1° · Slides: No; all features eject along +Y</div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"mass\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"production\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\">● Gray: AZ91D · Black: PC+GF · Gold: feed / overflow</div>\n<div class=\"legend\">● Slate: conceptual dies · Blue: adhesive track / cavity</div>\n<div id=\"status\">Loading opaque assembly reference…</div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate</button><button id=\"mold\">Mold view</button><button id=\"open\">Open mold</button><button id=\"ref\">Hide reference</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nimport { GLTFLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js';\nconst P = {\n // Dimensions in mm; densities in g/cm³.\n width:312,depth:217,radius:8,wall:0.8,flangeHeight:6.5,flangeThickness:1,\n ribWidth:0.8,ribHe